---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="Earn massive 6X rewards on Drift and Transform races this weekend! Plus, unlock the Glitch Camo livery for the Cypher, test out new Drift Tuning vehicles, and claim GTA$100,000 in the Weekly Challenge."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">August 27, 2026 — September 2, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    Get ready to race! Earn <span style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-weight: 700;">3X rewards</span> on Random Transform Races featuring five new tracks, and a massive <span style="color: var(--accent-orange); font-weight: 700;">6X weekend bonus</span> on select Drift and Transform Races. Plus, take advantage of new Drift Tuning upgrades and unlock the exclusive Glitch Camo livery for the Übermacht Cypher.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Participate in three Drift Races to receive GTA$100,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Livery Unlock:</strong> Complete a Drift Race in the Übermacht Cypher to receive the Glitch Camo drift livery (within 72 hours)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>New Races:</strong> Five New Random Transform Races added (Known Unknowns and Unknown Unknowns)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>New Drift Tuning:</strong> Upgrades now eligible for the Annis Elegy Retro, Invetero Coquette & Vapid Dominator GTT</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">6X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Drift and Transform Races (AUG 28-30 Weekend Only)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Random Transform Races (Known Unknowns and Unknown Unknowns)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$, RP & LSCM REP:</strong> Drift Races</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$, RP & LSCM REP:</strong> Auto Shop Robbery Contracts</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Annis ZR350, Buckingham Howard NX-25, Cheval Taipan, Invetero Coquette D5, Karin Technical Aqua, Obey I-Wagen, RC Bandito, Vapid Flash GT, and Western Company Duster 300-H</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (30% OFF):</strong> Military Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (40% OFF GTA+):</strong> Precision Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Railgun, Grenade Launcher, Heavy Pistol, Crowbar, Pipe Bombs, Tear Gas & Grenades</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Karin Sultan Classic</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Dinka Veto Classic (Place Top 5 in the LS Car Meet Series for four days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Albany V-STR, Fathom FR36, Invetero Coquette, Vapid Dominator FX & Vapid Dominator GTT</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Grotti Itali Classic & Pfister Astrale</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Cheval Taipan, Invetero Coquette D5 & Vapid Flash GT</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Imponte Arbiter GT</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Boots On The Ground</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Storm Drain (Standard) & North Chumash to Palomino Highlands (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> Breathless, Twindifference, Teckels</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Fine Art File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The Podium Robbery - Dewbauchee Champion</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Obey Tailgater S</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Cargo Ship Robbery - Vapid Clique</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>